WEBVTT

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.530
Who would've thought that in
the one month that I'd been away,

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:14.830
the dungeon's difficulty
would go up so much...

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.830
At any rate, we have to beat the dungeon.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:23.340
Our goal is to gain the power
of the ruins before Belza does

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.090
and prevent her from using it.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.420
Yes, yes.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.300
And using the power of the ruins,
we'll pay back my loans!

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.340
Yes, yes...

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.390
Huh?!

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.890
Aren't the loans your personal problem...?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:44.190
Exactly! Making us help pay back
your loans?! That's pure evil!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:49.780
Pure evil! Squatter and moocher! Makes
women and children pay back his loans!

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.240
Ninomiya, you're possibly
the most unreliable man in existence.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.950
Shut up!

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:55.990
Stop being so loud in my house!

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.450
And stop gnawing on me!

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:06.000
Oh, by the way,
Mr. Ninomiya, please look at this.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.920
What's this?

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:12.760
A copy of our statistical evaluation
sheets, I borrowed it from Headquarters.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.970
Don't you see?

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:21.980
The average adventurer achieves level 20.
Mr. Ninomiya, you're at level 5!

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.140
So weak!

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:25.520
Too weak, Mr. Ninomiya!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.860
Uh, yeah...

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:31.280
At this rate, you could die
the moment you enter the dungeon!

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.910
Therefore!

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:41.200
Starting today, I will begin
Kinou Shia's Short and Intensive Training!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.710
Huh?

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.390
First, we work on your basic stamina!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.640
Faster!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.520
Sprint! Sprint!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:33.940
Too slow! How are you going
to outrun monsters like that?!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.900
Sprint! Sprint!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.120
Shoulders. Keep your shoulders up!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.790
Impossible!

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.590
T-Too heavy!

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.140
Nope! No small talk!

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.600
Hot!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.310
Come on, 30 more seconds to go!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.810
Hot!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.110
Next up, this!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.990
A training system for
acquiring magical power!

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.660
We adventurers, to varying degrees,

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.540
all fight by boosting our physical
abilities using magical power.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.960
It is certainly very dependent on
each person's talents and aptitudes,

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:36.460
but I'll make sure you can freely
manipulate the magic power in your body.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.880
Magic power? I don't have that...

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:45.100
This is a device that I created that
rapidly activates a person's sixth sense.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:45.760
It works by--

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:46.930
I can tell!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.560
Those logs come flying
at you from all sides!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:53.020
Wow! How did you figure that out?!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.320
Are you an idiot, Shia?!
Shia, are you an idiot?

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.820
Hmph, twice?

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:02.860
I'm telling you from experience,
this works. There's no doubt.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.660
Break! Break time! Time to take a break!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.710
Ninomiya.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.960
Here you go, a little something
to get your energy up.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.010
Hey, thanks...

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:22.680
Here's one for you, Mr. Wanibe.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.970
You're worse than I imagined.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.970
Thank you.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:31.890
If I knew what abilities you had,
I could train that specific talent...

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.480
Go!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.360
Go! Go!

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:42.570
Is Mr. Ninomiya's only talent
the ability to manipulate others...?

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.830
This is delicious.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:51.500
It's apparently a potion mixed
with flavored syrups.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:55.080
It's less expensive than an actual potion,
so it's pretty popular now.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.750
Sort of like an energy drink, huh.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.970
Dammit! That didn't exist
in this world yet?

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:05.890
I should have filed a patent when I made
those watered-down potions back then.

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.970
What's a "patent"?

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.060
Hey! Pay attention!

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:12.560
I was listening!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:15.310
You were saying that
Ninomiya is worthless, right?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.150
What?!

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:17.110
Exactly.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.400
What?!

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:19.860
Wonderful!

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:24.150
Ninomiya, you've got every single
element that makes a man useless.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.200
None of your business.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:30.080
Besides, what is this "level" thing
you're talking about, anyway?

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.580
It's not like we're in a game

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.710
where we gain experience
points by killing monsters.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.170
How did you get that idea?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:44.420
Stop babbling nonsense! No more resting,
time to continue training!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.180
No! I said, if that
stupid machine could teach magic,

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:51.970
all the people in my world
would be mages by now!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.930
"My world"?

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:57.270
You really haven't paid
any attention to what I said.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:00.520
This is not for using magic,
it's for feeling the magical power--

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.860
Just wait a sec!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.820
I've been wondering
this whole time, but...

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.990
What is this "magic power"
that you keep mentioning?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.490
What a strange question.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.250
It's what you get when
you convert airborne mana into

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.040
a force that can actually have
an effect in the world.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.920
Huh? What does that mean?

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:23.130
"Magic" is what humans
use to create magical effects.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.090
The crystal form you see
in dungeons is "demonite."

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.760
"Sorcery" is a form of magic that is
used by building it into formulas.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:34.470
These energies are
essential to our daily lives.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.770
Why would you ask such
basic questions at this point?

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.900
So, what's that thing you said about
boosting physical power with magic power?

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.570
It means literally that.
You convert mana into magic power,

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.490
then circulate the magic
power inside your body.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:52.160
It raises your power to
otherwise impossible heights.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:53.200
Huh?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:57.000
Wait, so this whole time,
you thought I was fighting like that

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.210
through sheer physical training only?

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.750
You weren't?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.090
Listen.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:09.180
You breathe in the mana from
your mouth into your mystic heart.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:13.310
Then you circulate it through
your meridians to manipulate it!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.770
I forgot... This is a different world...

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.900
How stupid am I?

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:29.820
Just because they look similar, doesn't
mean they're the same on the inside...

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.740
Huh? Wait...

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.580
Does this mean... Perhaps...

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:38.410
Am I the weakest person
on this entire world?!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.590
You know what!

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:45.340
I knew it...

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:48.170
I knew life can't be that easy!

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.010
Tell you the truth, I did get my hopes up.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.800
Just a tiny bit.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:09:00.310
"Oh really? I can do fantasy-world
things like magic, too?" Bah!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.270
I want to go back in time
and silence myself!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.940
Ninomiya... Maybe you've had enough...

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.690
Shia, that idiot...

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.990
How can she smile in that situation...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.910
Oh, I see.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.870
You can't use any magic power either.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:23.750
Well, that's fine.
Let's just train your muscles!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.960
Training is forever!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.210
That's why I say she
has muscles instead of brains!

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.800
Dammit!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.310
I've really learned my lesson this time.

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:41.810
I'm completely the outsider here!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:46.480
I want to go back to the life
where I had nothing to worry about!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:53.530
I'm doing everything
I can to make myself happy!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:54.910
So why...

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:59.870
Why does everything slip away
from my grasp so easily...?

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.710
Dammit! Enough already!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:07.710
I don't want to drink this cheap booze.
I want to shower in the good stuff!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.590
Money! I want money!

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:13.010
So much money that
I don't ever have to work again!

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:17.300
Yes! Money like I had
back in Japan! That life!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.350
I want it!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:28.060
If there is a god in this world,
I curse them to the fullest extent...

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.320
N-Ninomiya...

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.660
Okay, I'm good.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:42.620
I see, I see. Letting out the stuff I had
pent up helped me sort things out.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.210
Wh-What is this sudden change...?

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:50.960
So, what I seek now is a
self-sufficient and lazy lifestyle.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.220
How impressive of me to
not waver from my original goal.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.470
He's in full control
of his own mental state!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.310
Impressive!

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:11.650
The power of the ruins...
The power to control the world.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.150
I have to admit, that's intriguing.
I have to have it.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.950
To get that, I must be strong enough
to survive in the dungeon...

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:22.080
Or no, I just need to get to it,
without necessarily fighting.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:27.000
Maybe I can make them do all
the fighting and focus on support...

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:29.040
Here I go, Rim!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.460
No, that won't work.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.710
Who knows what catastrophe would
ensue if I let those idiots run amok?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.590
Star-Gun-Magical-Chaser! Eat this!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.760
Rawr, bring it!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.600
Should I increase
the number of party members?

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:46.310
No... I can't trust
anyone I can't control.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.820
Oh, what about the ants?

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:57.570
They all went into hiding
when the dungeon changed shape,

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:02.240
but if they were around,
I could expand my strategic options...

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:05.290
Shut up! I'm trying to think!

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.750
If you want to make noise,
get out of my house!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.620
It's my house.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.130
Besides, this is mine!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:15.050
Just because it doesn't work anymore,
doesn't make it a toy!

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:20.010
What? Come on,
you robbed it from my village!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.390
Stop making it sound bad!

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:24.850
Besides, it doesn't work at all, right?

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:28.390
Even if it doesn't work as a gun,
there are still other uses.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.900
I could sell it off
as an antique, for example.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:36.190
At any rate, don't get this thing
needlessly scratched up, or else...

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.950
Hey! I was just done saying--

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.780
What?!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.880
I have absorbed enough mana to boot up.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.670
Beginning reboot process now.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:00.760
Reboot...? What's going on?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.350
It suddenly started talking!

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:04.930
Beginning bio-scan...

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.310
What a weird voice!

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:12.400
Scan complete. Human type confirmed.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.520
Use of this device has been authorized.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:19.440
The primary objective of this device
is to protect the life of the user

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.950
during dangerous situations.

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:27.790
In other words,
I will destroy all enemies.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:31.960
Please verbally input the password
to unlock security measures.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:36.710
Password? Like, 123456?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.090
Wrong password.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:41.930
Nobody does that.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:47.140
Don't be stupid. It's the most used
password back where I come from.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.640
How about "QWERTY"?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.100
What's that?

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:55.730
It's just another overused password...

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.860
Password confirmed. Unlocking.

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:01.030
What?! No way!

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:03.450
This is from a keyboard...

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:09.040
Please register the user of this device
to complete the boot process.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:11.660
Please state your name.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.960
I will take back what I said earlier.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:17.460
Ninomiya... Kinji Ninomiya.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:22.760
OK. Registration complete.
Master Ninomiya.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:29.220
This device is designed to bring comfort
to your combat needs as a humanoid.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:34.640
God, sorry about all
the cursing I did earlier.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.440
It looks like you're...

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.980
One heck of a generous provider!

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:52.080
Let's double-check our mission,
just in case.

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:53.790
Take a look at this.

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:57.460
Day one, reach the
staging point on the third floor.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:59.960
Day two, gather supplies.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:03.380
Day three, reach the point
just before the fourth floor.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:07.890
Day four, reach the monster-free
zone on the fourth floor.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:13.850
Our priority is to catch up
with Belza's pet adventurers.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:18.980
They're currently at the
Gatekeeper to the fifth floor.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.320
Fifth floor...

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:21.400
Yes.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:26.110
Apparently, the monsters there are extra
strong, so they're stuck there, for now.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:30.280
But all of Raiza'ha's best
are headed there as we speak.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.660
I'd say it's a matter of time
before they break through.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.920
What's wrong?

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:42.170
Maybe... That woman, she might
be aware of the existence of the ruins.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:47.720
So that's why we have to rush
through to their position, right?

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:52.140
If we had a Shift Crystal, we'd be able
to push ourselves a bit harder, but...

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:57.480
It seems like the supply of essential
exploration items are being limited.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:04.320
Dammit... Does this company
want us to win or not?

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:09.450
Well, at least I have the
bare essentials stocked up on hand.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.580
However, things aren't
going to be easy from here.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:14.200
Even the most experienced
veterans use scapegoats

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:17.830
and grind tactics to get through.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:23.550
Even I, a person who's referred to
as a "Hero," might have a hard time.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:25.840
We'd need to be
very sure about our abilities.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.090
Ninomiya would certainly have no chance...

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:33.010
Heh, you worry too much.
What are you, my wife?

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.020
What?! What are you saying?!

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:39.690
I'm genuinely worried
about your well-being!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.730
Ninomiya! Monsters!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.190
Huh?

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.820
I'll take the vanguard!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.160
Wanibe, Ranga, please support from behind.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:50.820
Yes.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.820
Got it!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.780
Rim, wake up. It's dinner time!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.080
Dinner!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:59.710
Other than that, please stay calm!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.040
Hold up, Shia.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.880
N-Ninomiya?

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.710
Leave this to me.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.090
Huh?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:19.640
Runic Gun: Blade Wing! It fits my hand
like a glove, more than I imagined!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:23.020
Hostile forces, eliminated.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:27.230
An artifact that absorbs mana from the
surroundings and converts it to energy...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:33.780
With auto-targeting, target-seeking,
and other useful features!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.620
Feels good! Now, I,
a person of great wisdom,

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:40.710
am equipped with physical strength
as well! That makes me...

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.580
Invincible!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.710
What's going on?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.550
This is only the third floor,

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:55.470
but those monsters aren't
supposed to be that easy either.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:59.180
Good job, Blade Wing!
You are the most incredible gun!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.350
Your compliments are most appreciated.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.400
Hehe, good gun.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:07.820
This device is arguably the
best weapon for monster destruction.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:10.650
Let's mop up the rest then!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:15.200
If I can score ingredients this easily,
I can make tons of money...

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:17.490
No more loans!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.000
Hmm?

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.540
What's wrong? Hey?

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.460
Come on, you!

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.710
Where is dinner? Where?

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.710
Come on! Work, damn you!

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.840
You've got to be kidding me...

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.260
What's wrong, Ninomiya? Did it break?

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.970
Insufficient energy reserves.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:42.810
Dangerous situation detected,
activating emergency protocols.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.230
Emergency?

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:51.360
Ninomiya... Based on personal experience,
I foresee a very bad outcome.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.860
Me too.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:04.830
Absorbing required mana
from the surroundings.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.380
Oh no! The demonite that we gathered!

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:10.880
What is this light?!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.670
Hey, hey!

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:18.550
What are you doing?!
Stop, you piece of junk!

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.310
I am not junk.

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:22.310
I'm not arguing with you!

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:24.980
Enough is enough!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.690
You must not discard me.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:35.900
Warning. Do not discard me.
Please don't dump me.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:40.450
Oh no! It's starting to sound
like a crazy stalker girl!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:40.450
Don't dump me.
Don't dump me. Don't dump me.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:47.620
Ugh! The clothing
has mana woven into it, too!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.880
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.630
Hey, Mr. Ninomiya!

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.210
Hmm?

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:54.710
What did you do?!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.800
Y-You guys...

00:19:58.470 --> 00:19:59.890
Huh?

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:07.520
What?! What is this?!

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:10.230
I really did it this time...

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.690
Idiot!

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:18.860
You did save me once,
but this is unforgivable! Ninomiya!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:24.700
This time, there's no room for excuses!
No room for sympathy, Mr. Ninomiya!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:29.790
Seriously, Mr. Ninomiya,
you always get carried away so easily!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.670
This isn't the first time!
Are you listening?!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:36.260
Enough. Wanibe, if you
have a weapon, hand it to me.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.840
Oh, right.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:43.430
This piece of junk... I'll use as backup
and use something else instead.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.560
I have this for now...

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:52.810
You have me, the ultimate weapon.
You have no need for any other weapon.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:54.570
This thing...

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:58.110
I'd lose tons of money if you keep
sucking up all the mana around you

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.860
every time you run out of energy!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.450
Now I have no choice but to wait
for you to run out of energy,

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:07.450
then sell you off as
a completely useless gun...

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:10.750
If you insist, I have no choice.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:14.750
10, 9, 8...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.840
Wait, wait, what is that countdown?

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:21.720
If this device cannot be allowed
to perform its original function,

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.050
this device will self-destruct.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.390
You!

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:28.430
Then get away from me!
Self-destruct on your own!

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:28.430
7, 6, 5...

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.060
No, I don't want to be lonely...

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:35.900
What?! The electronic brain established
the worst identity possible!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:38.690
I have serious worries about
the sanity of the ones who made you!

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:43.450
Too lonely... Self-destruct together...
Self-destruct together...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:50.330
Fine! I'll figure out a way
to put you to good use.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.620
So stop self-destructing!

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.380
Really?

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:58.840
Really! So just calm down, okay?

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:01.260
Yes.

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:04.970
This device is the perfect weapon,
your perfect partner.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:04.970
It must be tough to be in your position.

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:06.930
SYes...

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:06.930
Yes, yes, I understand...

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.270
You sound like a
high-maintenance girlfriend...
